stream
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 717 Tm (3. Definitions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Privileged account: an account that can change a system's configuration, its security settings, other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686.5 Tm (accounts or data that other people rely on.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (Orphaned account: a privileged account with no named owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 649.5 Tm (Leaver: an employee or contractor whose work for the Bank has ended.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 631 Tm (Leaving date: the last day a leaver works for the Bank.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 612.5 Tm (Business day: a day other than a Saturday, a Sunday or a bank holiday.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 594 Tm (Reviewer: the platform owner, or a person the platform owner names, who decides for each privileged) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 580.5 Tm (account whether it is still needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 562 Tm (Deputy reviewer: the reviewer who decides on an account that the usual reviewer cannot decide on.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Access management standard, version 4.0 - page 3 of 8) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
