stream
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 717 Tm (4. Leavers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (4.1 From 2026-04-01, the identity team removes a leaver's access within one business day of the leaving) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686.5 Tm (date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (4.2 For an employee, the HR system sends a leaver notice to the identity tool. For a contractor, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 654.5 Tm (contractor management team tells the identity team on the contractor's last day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 636 Tm (4.3 A line manager who learns that a person has left, and sees no sign that their access was removed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 622.5 Tm (tells the identity team the same day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 604 Tm (4.4 The identity team keeps a record of each leaver, the leaving date and the date each account was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 590.5 Tm (removed, and reports how many leavers were removed outside the deadline each month.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Access management standard, version 4.0 - page 4 of 8) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
