stream
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 717 Tm (5. Privileged access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (5.1 Each platform owner reviews every privileged account on it at least once in each calendar quarter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 681.5 Tm (5.2 A reviewer completes the reviewer training before their first review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 663 Tm (5.3 No reviewer certifies an account they hold. Such an account goes to the deputy reviewer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 644.5 Tm (5.4 Access a reviewer decides to revoke is removed within 30 days of the decision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (5.5 The review tool keeps each decision, its reviewer and its date for 7 years.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 607.5 Tm (5.6 An account without a named owner is dealt with under section 6, and joins the quarterly review once it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 594 Tm (has one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Access management standard, version 4.0 - page 5 of 8) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
