BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 717 Tm (6. Orphaned accounts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (6.1 Every privileged account has a named owner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 681.5 Tm (6.2 An account found with no named owner is removed, or assigned a named owner, within 120 days of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (the date it was found.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 649.5 Tm (6.3 The platform owner records the outcome for each orphaned account, with its date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Access management standard, version 4.0 - page 6 of 8) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
