BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (7.1 The Board Risk Committee approves this standard and any change to it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 681.5 Tm (7.2 The Chief Information Security Officer may approve an exception to this standard for up to 90 days) Tj ET
